    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim the sacred. Banish the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient temple has been desecrated by hordes of evil creatures, and only you can restore its former glory. Face relentless waves of enemies in intense battles, choosing between first-person, third-person, or top-down view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against monsters, bats, and fierce zombies as you recover the lost sacred artifacts. Unlock and upgrade a devastating arsenal of weapons, and survive long enough to recruit allies like combat drones, sword-wielding warriors, or even a helicopter to back you up in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your strategy with powerful spells and artifacts: place explosive mines, summon meteorites, or unleash mystical abilities that will turn the tide of battle. And when the fight is over\u2026 rebuild the temple your way, customizing it with statues and relics that reflect your victory.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reclaim the sacred. Banish the darkness.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ancient temple has been desecrated by hordes of evil creatures, and only you can restore its former glory. Face relentless waves of enemies in intense battles, choosing between first-person, third-person, or top-down view.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against monsters, bats, and fierce zombies as you recover the lost sacred artifacts. Unlock and upgrade a devastating arsenal of weapons, and survive long enough to recruit allies like combat drones, sword-wielding warriors, or even a helicopter to back you up in battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your strategy with powerful spells and artifacts: place explosive mines, summon meteorites, or unleash mystical abilities that will turn the tide of battle. And when the fight is over\u2026 rebuild the temple your way, customizing it with statues and relics that reflect your victory.</p>",
    "short_description": "Face endless hordes of zombies and monsters in this intense shooter, where you can play in first-person, third-person, or top-down view. Unlock new weapons, recruit powerful allies, explore new maps, and take on increasingly challenging enemies.",
